        "columns": [
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "“To overcome the challenges of today, we, humans, have to learn to align and harmonize with the living systems that surround us. Resilience Earth is one of the pioneer organizations that does this, working with and for the local community in which they are integrated.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "- Leen Gorisen, specialized in ecology, transition sciences, regenerative design and bio-inspired innovation. Author of the book ‘Building the Future of Innovation, on millions of yeras of Natural Intelligence’ and founder of Centre4NI.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "titleHeading": null,
            "alias": null,
            "media": null,
            "styles": {
              "cssClass": "col-md-10 offset-md-1",
